From eb3348117ebd9b67bc894719bd05da03fd1fb1cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ozgur Guzeldereli <ozgur@guzeldereli.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 05:00:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] CUDA: TQ1_0 matrix-vector and dequantization; TQ2_0
 through MMQ (the Q2_K kernels with unit sub-block scales)

TQ1_0: one int of base-3 codes per thread, branch-free across the three code regions, two bytes per 16-bit lane;
bit-identical decode NLL to the CPU layout (0.8B TTF 2.587994). 27B TTF: 16.8 tok/s at 7.87 GiB (TQ2_0: 23.1 at
9.23 GiB). TQ2_0 MMQ: prefill without the fp16 copy of the weight; NLL 2.5889 vs 2.5883 through cuBLAS.
